{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/3c9939e4174977eedcd176bd510c2284.poster.avif?t=1768486213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/3c9939e4174977eedcd176bd510c2284.webm?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/3c9939e4174977eedcd176bd510c2284.mp4?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atrion Project is a fast-paced, intense 2D action game blending hack-and-slash, platforming, and die &amp; retry mechanics, all set in a dark and mysterious sci-fi universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Atrion, a cybernetic hybrid with no memory, stranded on an unknown planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: recover the scattered parts of your ship, face deadly enemies, and uncover the secret of who you are...<br>You won\u2019t be alone, a few precious allies will stand by your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/7361fc46c9be60bae7a22beed524f89a.poster.avif?t=1768486213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/7361fc46c9be60bae7a22beed524f89a.webm?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/7361fc46c9be60bae7a22beed524f89a.mp4?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a fluid and intuitive combat system, built for fast reaction and smooth control, no unnecessary complexity, just precision and impact.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique abilities and take down memorable bosses in a progression designed to test your reflexes and sense of timing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/f292ba763103a8852c0a742c91afbab7.poster.avif?t=1768486213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/f292ba763103a8852c0a742c91afbab7.webm?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/f292ba763103a8852c0a742c91afbab7.mp4?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Atrion, unlock a variety of powers, and adapt your playstyle to overcome increasingly intense challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/db10bf97253a6c96e2b5b0b00ac00594.poster.avif?t=1768486213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/db10bf97253a6c96e2b5b0b00ac00594.webm?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/db10bf97253a6c96e2b5b0b00ac00594.mp4?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge is real but always fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory brings you one step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/a6f9328a92b071e7075b2923f59610dd.poster.avif?t=1768486213\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/a6f9328a92b071e7075b2923f59610dd.webm?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/extras/a6f9328a92b071e7075b2923f59610dd.mp4?t=1768486213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOR FANS OF:</strong><br><i>Dead Cells, ScourgeBringer, Katana Zero, Axiom Verge, Furi</i><br><i>...and stylized, mysterious, hostile sci-fi worlds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will fall. Learn. Retry. Better be ready.</strong><br><strong>Add it to your wishlist now.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2451700?t=1768486213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/3dd79ef75ecf661d42613708a3642bba81f4d2ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768486213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/28f733bcaa2726e057cb9848b9bd5fb63ea7c7d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768486213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451700/28f733bcaa2726e057cb9848b9bd5fb63ea7c7d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768486213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3075600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s